Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Deadmines \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 18-21 Deadmines]
[NX 19-22 Wailing Caverns]

-- Alliance: Stormwind pickups, then the Westfall chains that unlock the dungeon quests.
[A Alliance] In the Dwarven District, Shoni the Shilent gives [QA2040 Underground Assault] [G62.6,34.1 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Wilder Thistlenettle, nearby, gives [QA167 Oh Brother. . .] and [QA168 Collecting Memories] [G70.3,40.8 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Fly to Sentinel Hill [F Sentinel Hill] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Climb the Sentinel Hill tower: Gryan Stoutmantle gives [QA65 The Defias Brotherhood] [G56.3,47.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] In the Sentinel Hill inn, Alba Fairmoon gives [QA92742 Testing the Wells] and [QA92744 Murloc Gills] [G52.5,53.0 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Use the sample kit at the Molsen Farm well *(the elite Foe Reaper 4000 roams the fields; Vultros, elite level 26, flies near the road)* [QC92742 Testing the Wells] [G46.1,38.1 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Use it again at the Jansen Stead well [QC92742 Testing the Wells] [G56.6,18.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Kill murlocs on the north shore for their gills [QC92744 Murloc Gills] [G53.2,11.1 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Back to Alba: turn in [QT92742 Testing the Wells] and [QT92744 Murloc Gills], accept [QA92745 The State of the Mines] [G52.5,53.0 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Kill Kobold Diggers in Jangolode Mine [QC92745,1 The State of the Mines] [G45.0,20.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Kill Riverpaw Miners in the Gold Coast Quarry [QC92745,2 The State of the Mines] [G29.5,48.0 Westfall] \\ On the way, Sergeant Brashclaw and Leprithus (rare elites, level 18-19) may be about.
[A Alliance] Return to Alba: turn in [QT92745 The State of the Mines] and accept [QA92747 Moonbrook Espionage] [G52.5,53.0 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Loot Suspicious Crates in Moonbrook [QC92747 Moonbrook Espionage] [G42.2,69.0 Westfall] \\ Forlorn Spirits (level 25-26) haunt the house north of town. Elite Defias Henchmen, Conjurers and Watchmen (level 15-18) guard the town.
[A Alliance] Back to Alba: turn in [QT92747 Moonbrook Espionage] and accept [QA92748 Explosive Consultation] [G52.5,53.0 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Fly to Lakeshire [F Lakeshire] [G56.6,52.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Cross the bridge north over the lake into Lakeshire [G27.5,53.0 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Find Wiley the Black at the Lakeshire inn: turn in [QT65 The Defias Brotherhood] and accept [QA132 The Defias Brotherhood] [G21.4,45.4 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Fly back to Sentinel Hill [F Sentinel Hill] [G25.3,59.0 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Gryan Stoutmantle: turn in [QT132 The Defias Brotherhood] and accept [QA135 The Defias Brotherhood] [G56.3,47.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Fly to Stormwind [F Stormwind] [G56.6,52.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Sprite Jumpsprocket in the Dwarven District: turn in [QT92748 Explosive Consultation], accept [QA92749 A Dynamite Plan] and [QA92750 Detonation at a Distance] [G61.9,30.6 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Get 10 Rough Dynamite. Engineers make it; others buy it from a player or the auction house [QC92749 A Dynamite Plan]
[A Alliance] In Old Town, give Jasper Fel [QT92750 Detonation at a Distance] and accept [QA92751 Detonation at a Distance] [G80.3,70.1 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Master Mathias Shaw is close by: turn in [QT135 The Defias Brotherhood] and accept [QA141 The Defias Brotherhood] [G78.3,70.7 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Back to Sprite: turn in [QT92749 A Dynamite Plan] and [QT92751 Detonation at a Distance], accept [QA92752 Explosive Consultation] [G61.9,30.6 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Fly to Sentinel Hill [F Sentinel Hill] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Gryan Stoutmantle: turn in [QT141 The Defias Brotherhood] and accept [QA142 The Defias Brotherhood] [G56.3,47.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Alba Fairmoon: turn in [QT92752 Explosive Consultation] and accept [QA92753 Destruction in Deadmines] [G52.5,53.0 Westfall]
[A Alliance] The Defias Messenger walks the roads out of Moonbrook toward the mines; kill him for his message [QC142 The Defias Brotherhood] [G45.1,69.3 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Bring the message to Gryan: turn in [QT142 The Defias Brotherhood] [G56.3,47.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] The Defias Traitor beside the tower offers [QA155 The Defias Brotherhood] [G55.7,47.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Escort him to Moonbrook until he shows you the hideout [QC155 The Defias Brotherhood] [G42.5,71.7 Westfall] \\ He cannot be shared; each player takes the escort.
[A Alliance] Back to Gryan: turn in [QT155 The Defias Brotherhood] and accept [QA166 The Defias Brotherhood] [G56.3,47.5 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Scout Riell, also at the tower, gives [QA214 Red Silk Bandanas] [G56.7,47.4 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Go to the Moonbrook building that hides the mine entrance [G42.5,71.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] In the mine, take the south branch before the portal. Kill the elite undead miners (level 17-18) for their union cards [QC168 Collecting Memories] [G42.2,82.6 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Foreman Thistlenettle is in the same tunnels; take his badge [QC167 Oh Brother. . .] [G42.2,82.6 Westfall]

-- Horde: no quests of its own. Paladins come for one class item.
[A Horde] The Deadmines has no Horde quests. Only Paladins on *A Moon-Kissed Blade* need it; everyone else can skip to the next guide.
[A Paladin, Horde] Take the zeppelin from the Tirisfal Glades towers to Grom'gol [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades] \\ A Decrepit Harvester (elite, level 8) roams near the towers.
[A Paladin, Horde] Or, from Orgrimmar, take the Grom'gol zeppelin at the tower outside the gate [G51.0,13.9 Durotar] \\ A Dustwind Eggtender (elite, level 12) lives south of the tower, and an Infernal (elite, level 30) stands just south-east of it.
[A Paladin, Horde] From Grom'gol, follow the road north [G35.6,15.6 Stranglethorn Vale] \\ Tigers, panthers, gorillas and Bloodscalp trolls (level 30-34) live beside the road; stay on it.
[A Paladin, Horde] Cross the river on the road bridge [G39.0,10.4 Stranglethorn Vale] \\ River Crocolisks and Sharptooth Frenzies (level 30-32) swim below the bridge.
[A Paladin, Horde] Keep north out of Stranglethorn Vale. Alliance soldiers (level 31-60, one elite) hold the camp by the road here, and Plague Spreaders (level 27-28) roam just east of it; slip past [G38.0,4.0 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Paladin, Horde] Keep on the road to the south crossroads of Duskwood [G45.0,70.0 Duskwood] \\ Lost Watchers, Stitched Patrollers, Nightterror Whelps and Defias Night Blades (level 24-27) stand at this crossroads.
[A Paladin, Horde] Turn west along the road to Raven Hill [G20.0,48.0 Duskwood] \\ Skeletal Horrors, Skeletal Fiends, Lost Knights (level 23-25) and a Disturbed Ghoul (level 30) haunt Raven Hill, and the Dark Rider (level 41) waits just east of it; keep to the road.
[A Paladin, Horde] Head south-west out of Raven Hill [G14.1,61.1 Duskwood]
[A Paladin, Horde] Cross the river bridge [G7.5,63.8 Duskwood]
[A Paladin, Horde] Follow the road west into Westfall; an Alliance agent stands at the border [G68.0,70.0 Westfall]
[A Paladin, Horde] Keep west to Moonbrook, staying south of Sentinel Hill (the elite Foe Reaper 4000 roams the fields). Enter the building that hides the mine [G42.5,71.7 Westfall]

Inside the Deadmines:
[A Alliance] [QC214 Red Silk Bandanas] Defias in and around the mine drop the bandanas; collect them on the way.
[A Paladin, Alliance] On *The Test of Righteousness*: Goblin Woodcarvers drop the Whitestone Oak Lumber [QC1654,1 The Test of Righteousness]
[A Paladin, Horde] On *A Moon-Kissed Blade*: Goblin Woodcarvers drop the Whitestone Oak Lumber [QC95036,3 A Moon-Kissed Blade]
[A Alliance] Kill Sneed's Shredder and loot the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket [QC2040 Underground Assault]
[A Alliance] Plant the explosives in the forge room where Gilnid works [QC92753 Destruction in Deadmines]
[A Alliance] Kill Edwin VanCleef on the ship and take his head [QC166 The Defias Brotherhood]
[A Alliance] VanCleef also drops a letter; read it and accept [QA373 The Unsent Letter]
[A Alliance] Do not hearth. Leave through the back exit and find Alba Fairmoon outside: turn in [QT92753 Destruction in Deadmines] and accept [QA92819 Destruction in Deadmines] [G38.7,83.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Use the detonator [QC92819 Destruction in Deadmines] [G38.7,83.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT92819 Destruction in Deadmines] with Alba [G38.7,83.7 Westfall]

