[A Alliance] Turn in [QT167 Oh Brother. . .] and [QT168 Collecting Memories] to Wilder [G70.3,40.8 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Bring the letter to Baros Alexston in the Cathedral Square [QT373 The Unsent Letter] [G57.7,47.9 Stormwind City]
